    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Deerfield Township was officially established on May 10, 1803.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.choosedeerfield.com/about-us/our-history/our-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early settlers arrived in the late 1790s, long before the township’s formal creation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.choosedeerfield.com/about-us/our-history/our-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "At its founding, Deerfield Township encompassed more than half of Turtlecreek Township, all of Union Township, and all of Salem Township north of the Little Miami River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.choosedeerfield.com/about-us/our-history/our-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the first forty years, elected “Overseers of the Poor” managed welfare for residents who could not support themselves.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.choosedeerfield.com/about-us/our-history/our-history/",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In the early 1800s, Deerfield became a vital crossroads, with roads soon linking it to Cincinnati and beyond.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.choosedeerfield.com/about-us/our-history/our-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The township once issued warrants to expel individuals it deemed likely to commit crimes or become a burden on the community.",
